{"id":"b78700f82584ead6","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-iteration-convergence.md","title":"单调幂集算子在集合长度内稳定","display":"thm-iteration-convergence — 单调幂集算子在集合长度内稳定","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-iteration-convergence","aliases":["91-thm-iteration-convergence","91-thm-truth-iteration-limit","91-thm-iteration-bound"],"display":"thm-iteration-convergence — 单调幂集算子在集合长度内稳定","depends_on":["[[91-df-monotonicity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-iteration-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-iteration-convergence</span><span>91-thm-truth-iteration-limit</span><span>91-thm-iteration-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-iteration-convergence — 单调幂集算子在集合长度内稳定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55157d609cf296e7\" href=\"?note=55157d609cf296e7\" title=\"91-df-monotonicity\">91-df-monotonicity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55157d609cf296e7\" href=\"?note=55157d609cf296e7\" title=\"91-df-monotonicity\">91-df-monotonicity</a> 的包含序单调性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(S))\">\\(\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(S))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(S)\">\\(\\Gamma:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha)\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha)\\)</span>、非零极限处取前阶段并来定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{A\\subseteq S:J(A)\\subseteq A\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{A\\subseteq S:J(A)\\subseteq A\\}\\)</span>，该候选集合的固定性及最小性在结论中建立。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\kappa\\,[\\kappa+1&lt;\\eta\\land\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\Gamma_{\\kappa+1}\n=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\land J(\\operatorname{lfp}(J))=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\eta\\,(\\kappa\\le\\alpha\\to\\Gamma_\\alpha=\\Gamma_\\kappa)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\kappa\\,[\\kappa+1&lt;\\eta\\land\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\Gamma_{\\kappa+1}\n=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\land J(\\operatorname{lfp}(J))=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\eta\\,(\\kappa\\le\\alpha\\to\\Gamma_\\alpha=\\Gamma_\\kappa)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由单调性作超限归纳，阶段递增。若所有有定义的相邻阶段都严格增长，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\mapsto\\Gamma_\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\mapsto\\Gamma_\\alpha\\)</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(S)\">\\(\\mathcal P(S)\\)</span> 的单射，违反 Hartogs 的定义，故有稳定阶段。稳定后所有阶段相同。\n对任一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(A)\\subseteq A\">\\(J(A)\\subseteq A\\)</span>，超限归纳给出每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\alpha\\subseteq A\">\\(\\Gamma_\\alpha\\subseteq A\\)</span>；稳定集合自己又是前固定点，故等于所示交集。这也证明其固定性及在全部固定点中的最小性。\n这是一般集合论结论，不使用真理公式的句法嵌套迭代，也不推出精确 Church–Kleene 闭包序数。</p>\n<p>来源：一般单调幂集构造的集合论证明；与原书 §15.1 的迭代背景对应，非原书编号定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"55157d609cf296e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-monotonicity]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"55157d609cf296e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为集合，$J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)$；$\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)$ 采用 [[91-df-monotonicity]] 的包含序单调性。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(S))","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{A\\subseteq S:J(A)\\subseteq A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\kappa\\,[\\kappa+1<\\eta\\land\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\Gamma_{\\kappa+1}\n=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\land J(\\operatorname{lfp}(J))=\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\eta\\,(\\kappa\\le\\alpha\\to\\Gamma_\\alpha=\\Gamma_\\kappa)].","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha\\mapsto\\Gamma_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(S)","display":false},{"tex":"J(A)\\subseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_\\alpha\\subseteq A","display":false}],"bytes":1986,"backlinks":[{"id":"2e7d619feee516bd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aa1ce7fbd5a355c2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(S))$；\n$\\Gamma:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(S)$ 为 [[91-thm-iteration-convergence]] 的序列：\n$\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing$、$\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha)$（$\\alpha+1<\\eta$），\n非零极限 $\\lambda<\\eta$ 处取 $\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta<\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta$。"},{"id":"3986b1fdb85a0caf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-iteration-convergence]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-iteration-convergence]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["55157d609cf296e7"]}